CodeSystem: DMEDPrescriptionInnCS
Id: dmed-prescription-inn-cs
Title: "DMED prescription INN"
Description: "International non-proprietary name (INN) identifiers of the DMED prescriptions API (`inn_id`), with their Uzbek, Russian and English names. A combination INN, such as ibuprofen + paracetamol, is one identifier; its components are separate identifiers. Exported from DMED on 2026-10-05."
* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(dmed-prescription-inn-cs)
* ^publisher = "Uzinfocom"

